# Everything is excluded, then the build inputs are named back in.
# A denylist silently ships whatever it has not heard of yet — a stray
# .env, a database someone left in the tree, a new cache directory from
# a tool adopted next month. An allowlist cannot.
*

# --- what the image is actually built from ---------------------------
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!netplanner/

# --- needed by the ci target only ------------------------------------
!tests/
!.github/

# --- re-excluded: these match the patterns above but are not inputs ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/*.db
**/*.log
